#: ../../docs/faq/login.rst:13 48907779d2ef4e0abf5dc763a56d015c
msgid "Why can't I connect to cnSRC?"
msgstr "Why can't I connect to cnSRC?"

#: ../../docs/faq/login.rst:15 1f1fd56706464f1bb9a9b002144c5b21
msgid "Please read the :ref:`login` section."
msgstr "Please read the :ref:`login` section."

#: ../../docs/faq/login.rst:17 a1a61bd056624efea6140a02126f4de8
msgid ""
"cnSRC currently does not support direct public network access, here you need "
"VPN or access address added to SHAO firewall. If you encounter connection "
"issues, please first check the network and confirm whether you are using VPN "
"or have already on the whitelist."
msgstr ""
"cnSRC currently does not support direct public network access, here you need "
"VPN or access address added to SHAO firewall. If you encounter connection "
"issues, please first check the network and confirm whether you are using VPN "
"or have already on the whitelist."

#: ../../docs/faq/login.rst:20 461122315a8243e4b05b61beda8bcd44
msgid ""
"It is recommended to join the \"ChinaSKA Prototype User Group\" WeChat "
"group, the notification of cnSRC will be released in the WeChat group in "
"time. If you need to join the user WeChat group, please send an email to "
"cnSRC mailto_ ."
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to join the \"ChinaSKA Prototype User Group\" WeChat "
"group, the notification of cnSRC will be released in the WeChat group in "
"time. If you need to join the user WeChat group, please send an email to "
"cnSRC mailto_ ."

